{"number":111,"nameArabic":"المسد","nameTransliterated":"Al-Masad","nameTranslated":"The Palm Fiber","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":5,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"111:1","textAr":"تَبَّتۡ يَدَآ أَبِي لَهَبٖ وَتَبَّ","transliteration":"Tabbat yada abee lahabin watabba","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ٹوٹ گئے ابولہب کے ہاتھ اور نامراد ہو گیا وہ"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"111:2","textAr":"مَآ أَغۡنَىٰ عَنۡهُ مَالُهُۥ وَمَا كَسَبَ","transliteration":"Ma aghna AAanhu maluhu wama kasaba","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس کا مال اور جو کچھ اس نے کمایا وہ اُس کے کسی کام نہ آیا"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"111:3","textAr":"سَيَصۡلَىٰ نَارٗا ذَاتَ لَهَبٖ","transliteration":"Sayasla naran thata lahabin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ضرور وہ شعلہ زن آگ میں ڈالا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"111:4","textAr":"وَٱمۡرَأَتُهُۥ حَمَّالَةَ ٱلۡحَطَبِ","transliteration":"Waimraatuhu hammalata alhatabi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور (اُس کے ساتھ) اُس کی جورو بھی، لگائی بجھائی کرنے والی"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"111:5","textAr":"فِي جِيدِهَا حَبۡلٞ مِّن مَّسَدِۭ","transliteration":"Fee jeediha hablun min masadin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس کی گردن میں مونجھ کی رسی ہوگی"}]}]}